entries[1239744] = { ["name"] = "Weekly Activity", ["text"] = "Instant\nCompleting this quest can reward you with a weekly Fractured Spark of Starlight. Two Fractured Sparks can be combined into a Spark of Starlight, which is used by professions to create powerful weapons and armor.\n\nIf you fall behind on these weekly sparks, completing other max-level content such as Delves, Mythic Plus, Raids, Instanced PvP, and some outdoor events may help you catch up.\n\nYou have already received your Fractured Spark of Starlight this week." }
